// RSQ Gore phase 1 cards -- GENERATED by Gore/tools/gen_gore.py (cards.py) from 1.00_brutal22test6.pk3. Never hand-edit.
//
// 1. One small class per Brutal Doom class we take over (RSQGO_Manager.CheckReplacement swaps BD's class for it by
//    name). It carries BD's Speed, because A_CustomMissile sets a spawned missile's velocity from the SPAWNED
//    actor's Speed (p_actionfunctions.cpp A_SpawnProjectile), and its card number. Hit bloods also keep BD's Decal
//    and PUFFGETSOWNER (so target is the victim exactly where BD's blood had it).
// 2. RSQGO_Data.Build(): every card's data (what the class shows, spawns and leaves), built at run time from the
//    tables below. Ranges index into the track, keyframe, child, give and texture arrays. A TRACK is BD's actor
//    tic by tic (cards.py variant_of): keyframes of texture (our baked copy of BD's frame), x/y scale, alpha and
//    Bright, played by a VisualThinker (emit.zs RSQGO_VT) exactly as BD's actor shows its sprite.

